Well how HOT do you want the copy to be,
Identical? You can replicate the storage at the SAN level over fibre
Within seconds ? You can mirror the disks using LSM (Software volume management)
Within minutes? You can buy third party products  to mirror disk writes across a network
Within hours? you can use rsync to keep a mirror on a remote machine.
