: my RA90 drive seems to be dying and I don't know why. It gives me an
: Error Code "E 7C" or maybe it's suppose to mean "E 1C". Unfortunately I
: don't have the manual for that drive. I wonder if someone has a manual
: handy so one could tell me what these Error Code actually mean.
: Any ideas/suggestions appreciated.

For 7C:

Gray code match error
After a  seek  has been commanded and the dedicated servo
is settled on  track, a check of the gray code is made to
verify that it is on track and not off by a track or two.  
(ECM, HDA)

For 1C:

Outer guard band error
The hardware detected the servo head decoding servo outer
guard band information when it  should have been decoding
servo  data  information  or  servo  inner    guard  band
information.
(ECM, HDA)

In either case, you have a seek error.

        Stu


