   -msg_enable). You can use the DEC_CC environment varibale to
   add additional flags without editting makefiles. Do the warnings
   point out any potential source code bugs?

 - try compiling at -O0 -g. Does the application still crash with
   no optimization?

 - try atom third degree (see man third) to help debug the application.

If you're still stuck and can provide a pointer to a reproducer,
someone here might be able to help.

