Patrick Schaefer <patrick.schaefer@topmail.de> writes:
> Are there any other tasks this board can perform? Can I use it as a RAID
> or as a LUN splitter?

  AFAIK, it's a LUN splitter - all the device ID's on one SCSI chain show
up as LUNs on a single ID on the other chain. Note that this can confuse
*some* drivers in very nasty ways - they can have hard-coded assumptions
like "if LUN 0 is a disk, no other LUN can be a tape".

