I like it and I don't like Pascal and Eiffel for the lack of case sensitivity. But this is mainly a matter of style, taste and cultural background. If you use a scripture which requires often to use uppercase letters depending of the semantics and sometimes even with different meaning if both ways are possible you will more likely vote for case sensitivity.

